<title>USA: Group raises share stake in Dreco Energy.</title>
<headline>Group raises share stake in Dreco Energy.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Centennial Energy Partners L.P. said Thursday it raised its stake in Dreco Energy Services Ltd to 491,700 common shares or 7.97 percent from 6.74 percent held previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 133,800 common shares bought between August 8 and October 8 at prices ranging from $22.625 to $26.375 per share.</p>
</text>
